// GamePi13 dashboard bitmaps, designed in Lopaka (lopaka.app), exported
// for TFT_eSPI/M5/Lovyan and adapted here (PROGMEM dropped, arrays
// renamed for clarity -- the originals in MODE_0.txt/"Digits for
// BPM.txt"/"Digits for bank files.txt" all used generic names like
// image__0_pixels that collide across files).
//
// All uint16_t arrays are RGB565, consumed via Paint_DrawImage() with a
// (const unsigned char*) cast -- verified byte-compatible on this
// little-endian target (ARM Cortex-M33), same reasoning as splash_logo.h.
// image_play_bits/image_stop_bits are 1bpp packed (MSB first), consumed
// via the new Paint_DrawMonoBitmap() instead.
//
// Pixel counts verified against each source w*h before import (see
// docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-19-dashboard-bitmap-mode0.md Task 1).
#pragma once
#include <stdint.h>

